####Question 1 : Microservice Design Pattern used in last project and explanation about the design
###################################################################################################

For your MUFG Risk Governance & Control (RCG) Project, this is a strong Senior Developer / Solution Architect interview answer.

Interview Answer:
 "Our application followed Domain-Driven Microservices with Event-Driven Architecture.
Services were independently deployable Spring Boot microservices running on AWS ECS/OpenShift.

Communication was both synchronous using REST APIs and asynchronous using Kafka.

We used API Gateway, Database-per-Service, Saga Pattern, Circuit Breaker, Retry Pattern, and Dead Letter Topics for resiliency."

